    },
    {
      "id": "setting",
      "section": "setting",
      "text": "Western Australia. Twenty thousand emus are eating the farmers' wheat. The farmers, all war veterans, beg the army for help.",
      "kokoro_speed": 1.2,
      "source_start_seconds": 9.17,
      "source_end_seconds": 16.045,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.1,
      "final_start_seconds": 7.4416,
      "final_end_seconds": 13.0207
    },
    {
      "id": "plan",
      "section": "plan",
      "text": "The army's plan? Three soldiers. Two machine guns. Ten thousand bullets. Easy win... right?",
      "kokoro_speed": 1.2,
      "source_start_seconds": 16.145,
      "source_end_seconds": 21.495,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.42,
      "final_start_seconds": 13.1019,
      "final_end_seconds": 17.4435
    },
    {
      "id": "day_one_cta",
      "section": "day_one",
      "text": "Day one: the emus split into tiny groups. Impossible to hit. If you're enjoying this, like and subscribe!",
      "kokoro_speed": 1.2,
      "source_start_seconds": 21.915,
      "source_end_seconds": 27.79,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.1,
      "final_start_seconds": 17.7843,
      "final_end_seconds": 22.552
    },
    {
      "id": "truck_comment",
      "section": "truck",
      "text": "So they mounted the gun on a truck. But emus run fifty kilometres an hour, and the truck bounced too much to aim. Comment now: army or emus, who wins round two?",
      "kokoro_speed": 1.2,
      "source_start_seconds": 27.89,
      "source_end_seconds": 36.29,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.1,
      "final_start_seconds": 22.6331,
      "final_end_seconds": 29.4499
    },
    {
      "id": "retreat",
      "section": "retreat",
      "text": "It gets worse. Within a week, the army retreated. Then they came back for round two... and got the same result.",
      "kokoro_speed": 1.2,
      "source_start_seconds": 36.39,
      "source_end_seconds": 41.99,
      "pause_after_seconds": 0.1,
      "final_start_seconds": 29.531,
      "final_end_seconds": 34.0755
    },
    {
      "id": "tally_setup",
      "section": "tally",
      "text": "Almost ten thousand bullets later, the emus were still eating.",
